    76	/**
    77	 * Mirrors the db store's atomic claim (M11-1 C16): null means the cooldown refused the post.
    78	 *
    79	 * **No `last_active_at` bump**, mirroring the db statement (M11-2 P1.1): the per-request
    80	 * authentication touch in `auth.ts` is the column's sole writer, and every post creation rides an
    81	 * authenticated request.
    82	 *
    83	 * The prepared events are appended in the same synchronous section as the insert, and their
    84	 * `post_id`/`subject_id` are filled from the id this function mints — the memory twin of the db
    85	 * statement's `columnSql`/`payloadMergeSql`, because the action cannot know an id the store has not
    86	 * created yet.
